B.bRB=s(["Tw\xf2p es\xe8. Tann tan an pase epi eseye ank\xf2.","Trop de tentatives. Attendez la fin du d\xe9lai puis r\xe9essayez.","Too many attempts. Wait for the cooldown and try again."],t.s)
