B.bp_=s(['S\xe8vis WhatsApp Cloud 24h/24 la ap demare oswa l ap tann koneksyon QR sou Liy 1.\n\ud83d\udc49 Klike sou bouton "K\xf2manse & Eskane QR" nan kat Liy 1 an oswa verifye UptimeRobot (/health) pou kenbe s\xe8v\xe8 Render Cloud la aktif 24h/24.','Le service WhatsApp Cloud 24h/24 est en cours de r\xe9veil ou attend le scan QR sur la Ligne 1.\n\ud83d\udc49 Cliquez sur "K\xf2manse & Eskane QR" sur la Ligne 1 et v\xe9rifiez UptimeRobot (/health) pour maintenir le serveur Render Cloud actif 24h/24.','The 24/7 Cloud WhatsApp gateway is waking up or awaiting QR pairing on Line 1.\n\ud83d\udc49 Click "Start & Scan QR" on Line 1 and keep UptimeRobot pinging /health to keep the Render Cloud server active 24/7.'],t.s)
